# transformed (plan section 6, M6's judgment): R3, a 2, h −1, k 1, P at 0.5, in Midnight Violet,
# whose --sig-curve-glow (primary at 60 %, radius 14) is the one glow a theme shows. The curve
# 2(x + 1)² + 1 glows; the ghost x² under it, 2 px dashed 6 6 at 75 %; the anchor ◆ at (−1, 1),
# the stretch grip ■ at (0, 3); P (0.50, 5.50) labelled; the Original toggle in the tools.
# Both type the values (M7 rewrote M6's model lines to the gesture, plan 5.1.5 (1)): a click on a
# box (its field, the reference's DOM at 1440 x 900: a's (352.5, 413.5, 62 x 22), k's 457.5, h's
# 562.5) opens it with its value selected, the typed text replaces it, Enter applies it; then P's
# x into its readout's field (308.78, 678.5, 43.22 x 24), which M8 made a field in the port too
# (its Enter hands the focus to P's track). A press on the top bar's empty middle then takes the
# focus off on both, and the pointer rests there. Each click waits a frame before the typing, as
# text input starts when the field opens.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme midnight-violet
wait 300
click 383 424
wait 16
type "2"
key Enter
click 383 468
wait 16
type "1"
key Enter
click 383 573
wait 16
type "-1"
key Enter
click 330 690
wait 16
type "0.5"
key Enter
click 760 48
wait 2000
shot transformed
